# A2 Twenty Write Governance

## When to Use

Use after provider values and LLM field decisions are validated.

## Commands

```bash
python scripts/build_twenty_enrichment_write_plan.py <proposal.json> --output <plan.json>
python scripts/push_twenty_enrichment.py <plan.json> --output <dry-run.json>
python scripts/push_twenty_enrichment.py <plan.json> --apply --output <result.json>
python scripts/validate_twenty_reconciliation.py <result.json> --output <validation.json>
```

Values must originate in validated evidence. Never silently overwrite manual values, mutate one person into another, or write personal email. New People require verified identity, `CURRENT_AT_COMPANY`, confirmed Company match and primary priority. `a2RoleStatus` may only be `CURRENT_AT_COMPANY`, `NOT_CURRENT_AT_COMPANY`, or `UNVERIFIED`. Company final status is the last operation. Twenty API success is incomplete until read-back matches.